WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:06.260
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and this week
on Arrow Huntress came back and gave us a

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:11.020
nice teaser for future Birds of Prey episodes
in season 3 and beyond.

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:17.520
There was a lot of secret identity revealing
teased and Slade also made a huge move against

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:18.520
Oliver.

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:21.820
So let’s start with a big question.

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:23.800
How far gone is too far gone.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:28.250
Let’s look at what happened to Helena in
this episode and apply that logic to Slade.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:30.800
First though, next week is a very Deathstroke
centric episode.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:35.069
So if you have questions about that or about
Birds of Prey, leave them in the comments

00:00:35.069 --> 00:00:36.739
and I’ll include them in my Q&amp;A video tomorrow.

00:00:36.739 --> 00:00:38.030
Be sure to subscribe to get that.

00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:40.239
The writers really did a lot to mirror the
Huntress and Deathstroke characters, so because

00:00:40.239 --> 00:00:41.499
there was so much awesome to talk about.

00:00:41.499 --> 00:00:46.510
Let’s do Top 5 moments and try to answer
the question, is Slade too far gone to come

00:00:46.510 --> 00:00:47.510
back.

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:49.420
Careful for spoilers if you haven’t seen
the episode yet.

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:53.329
Here we go, Number 5 - Secret Identities being
revealed.

00:00:53.329 --> 00:00:56.859
Felicity’s quote heavily foreshadows the
next couple of episodes.

00:00:56.859 --> 00:01:00.659
It’s getting really hard to tell who know’s
whose secret identity.

00:01:00.659 --> 00:01:04.390
Marc Guggenheim revealed that more people
are going to learn Oliver’s secret identity.

00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:08.810
Based on the situation Thea got herself into
in the last couple minutes of the episode

00:01:08.810 --> 00:01:10.930
and the cell phone moment Detective Lance
had with Oliver.

00:01:10.930 --> 00:01:14.110
I think it’s safe to say they’re both
going to learn who’s been shooting all those

00:01:14.110 --> 00:01:15.640
baby Arrows around.

00:01:15.640 --> 00:01:19.890
Detective Lance in particular has been getting
more and more complicit with the Arrow since

00:01:19.890 --> 00:01:21.430
Sara started working with him.

00:01:21.430 --> 00:01:24.610
It’s like he’s an unspoken member of the
team.

00:01:24.610 --> 00:01:28.240
Gordon never learned Batman’s identity,
or at least never let it show that he knew.

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:34.150
So I hope Lance does the same thing with Oliver.

00:01:34.150 --> 00:01:39.470
I want him to figure it out, but I like the
idea of Oliver not knowing that he knows.

00:01:39.470 --> 00:01:43.520
Thea on the other hand is probably not going
to take it very well.

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:45.020
Everyone has been lying and keeping secrets
from her.

00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:48.040
It just feels like they’re clearing the
path for Merlin to swoop in.

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:52.120
The John Barrowman cameo meter is off the
scale right now.

00:01:52.120 --> 00:01:55.200
I also really though the Canary would reveal
herself to Laurel.

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:57.520
Which I also think is coming.

00:01:57.520 --> 00:02:02.690
Remember the title of Episode 19 is The Man
Under The Hood.

00:02:02.690 --> 00:02:05.530
But that doesn’t mean that they Canary couldn’t
out herself to Laurel.

00:02:05.530 --> 00:02:11.349
Who else gets the vibe that pretty soon it’s
going to be open war against anyone in a mask.

00:02:11.349 --> 00:02:12.349
Bad or good..

00:02:12.349 --> 00:02:14.779
Number 4 - For the Record Don’t Call Me
Speedy.

00:02:14.779 --> 00:02:19.379
Marc Guggenheim keeps using the Arsenal name
when talking about Roy, but technically they’re

00:02:19.379 --> 00:02:21.139
not really settling on anything yet.

00:02:21.139 --> 00:02:25.129
Oliver called Roy Speedy not because he wanted
to give him that nickname.

00:02:25.129 --> 00:02:29.909
But just to remind him of Thea to shock him
out of his mirakuru induced rage coma.

00:02:29.909 --> 00:02:34.930
It’s possible that if Thea is the one to
die this season, Roy could take up the name

00:02:34.930 --> 00:02:36.659
Speedy to honor her.

00:02:36.659 --> 00:02:41.790
The list of candidates for people who Slade
will kill is really being localized to Oliver’s

00:02:41.790 --> 00:02:42.790
family.

00:02:42.790 --> 00:02:47.200
Thea, being the biggest teaser going into
next week.

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:50.900
It seemed like Roy agreed with Oliver’s
request to keep her at a distance.

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:55.900
So I don’t expect Slade to turn Roy against
Oliver, but I do think the writers will tease

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:58.209
that in episode 20.

00:02:58.209 --> 00:03:01.250
Seeing Red.

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:04.950
They keep focusing on how pissed off Roy gets.

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:07.840
Like that last scene with him smashing the
bracelet.

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:14.019
I have a feeling Roy is going to ‘let the
darkness in’.

00:03:14.019 --> 00:03:16.650
Number 3 - Laurel Let’s the Darkness In

00:03:16.650 --> 00:03:18.790
Her last scene just felt so sinister.

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:22.529
But I think they just want us to think that
Laurel isn’t going use baby Arrows to go

00:03:22.529 --> 00:03:24.329
after what she wants.

00:03:24.329 --> 00:03:27.640
Teeing up her confrontation with Brother Blood.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:32.290
It really feels like with Oliver going after
Slade, she’ll be responsible for dealing

00:03:32.290 --> 00:03:35.109
with the underling.

00:03:35.109 --> 00:03:39.309
Earlier this year, everyone was wondering
if they would kill Sara off and use that as

00:03:39.309 --> 00:03:42.400
the catalyst for Laurel to become the true
Black Canary.

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:48.749
As much as she’s course corrected her life,
I don’t feel like that’s going to happen.

00:03:48.749 --> 00:03:52.700
It just feels like they’re investing so
much in Caity Lotz’ Canary that it would

00:03:52.700 --> 00:03:57.049
be a complete waste of an amazing character
to kill her off right after teasing a Birds

00:03:57.049 --> 00:03:58.900
of Prey team-up in a future season.

00:03:58.900 --> 00:04:04.930
If you’re not sure about that, the final
scene is almost a dead giveaway that Huntress

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:10.730
will be given the Suicide Squad speech at
some point.

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:18.600
Hopefully she’ll be back before the finale.

00:04:18.600 --> 00:04:20.900
Number 2 - The Canary VS The Huntress

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:25.480
There were two awesome fight scenes with some
nice Oliver jokes.

00:04:25.480 --> 00:04:28.180
Just that Oliver definitely has a type.

00:04:28.180 --> 00:04:31.740
And that type is stabby girls in black leather.

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:37.130
I loved their fight scenes, both of them.

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:40.990
Especially Canary getting pushed out the window.

00:04:40.990 --> 00:04:45.390
I thought it was nice that Sara’s only reaction
to learning about Oliver’s relationship

00:04:45.390 --> 00:04:48.420
with her was with subtle bemusement.

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:52.200
That’s one of the things that I think Arrow
is doing well.

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:57.800
Not defining it’s female characters in terms
of their sexual relationships the male characters.

00:04:57.800 --> 00:05:03.340
Also I thank them for downplaying the love
triangles, I’m sure tumblr has some really

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:05.590
funny Slade Oliver ‘ships though.

00:05:05.590 --> 00:05:07.900
I generally try to avoid those types of posts.

00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:10.020
So I don’t have to burn my eyes out.

00:05:10.020 --> 00:05:15.540
and my Number 1 moment - Slade takes Thea
and sets the stage for the beginning of the

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:16.810
end.

00:05:16.810 --> 00:05:21.320
Remember my big question, how far gone is
too far gone for Slade.

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:26.960
Oliver tried to kill him on the island.

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:30.670
But taking Thea with the assumption that he’ll
threaten to kill her kind of makes it seem

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:33.500
like that’s what’s going to be the point
of no return for him.

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:38.240
They haven’t mentioned Jericho or Ravager
in several episodes, but I’m still holding

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:45.860
out hope that Oliver will use them to try
and bring Slade back mentally.

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:50.570
The next episode, Deathstroke, is actually
a deep dive into Slade’s head.

00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:54.340
It’s really like a complete Slade story
for an hour.

00:05:54.340 --> 00:05:57.710
Connecting more dots from the island to now.

00:05:57.710 --> 00:06:02.900
We’ll also get more of an explanation of
what the mirakuru has done to his brain.

00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:04.740
Because it’s really the reason all this
is happening.

00:06:04.740 --> 00:06:09.630
They spent the entire episode mirroring Huntress’
story with Slade’s.

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:13.080
And she found some redemption, or at least
came back to sanity.

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:19.170
I think it’s foreshadowing that Oliver will
be able to redeem Slade a little.

00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:23.040
Not completely, because I’m hoping that
Slade continues to develop as Deathstroke

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:26.080
the mercenary in future seasons.

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:31.100
But enough to stop him from trying to destroy
Oliver.

00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:36.280
They’ll probably be frenemies for life given
all that’s happened between them.

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:39.030
But now it’s your turn to answer my question.

00:06:39.030 --> 00:06:42.830
Can Oliver redeem Slade this season?

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:45.990
Will the darkness quote unquote, ever get
out?

00:06:45.990 --> 00:06:50.210
Overall the episode was a solid B plus for
use of Huntress.

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:53.360
I loved her character and how dark they made
her.

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:58.150
Last time we saw her in season 1 she was pissed
off and stabby, this time she was a full on

00:06:58.150 --> 00:06:59.210
killer.

00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:01.470
Not so much that she couldn’t find some
redemption.

00:07:01.470 --> 00:07:05.840
But it seemed like her Helena persona returned
by the end.

00:07:05.840 --> 00:07:09.960
I’m so hoping Amanda Waller pays her a visit
soon.

00:07:09.960 --> 00:07:13.800
How else will they be able to do a Birds of
Prey episode next season?

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:17.850
Felicity had one of the best lines of the
episode even though it feels like she was

00:07:17.850 --> 00:07:19.860
barely part of the story.

00:07:19.860 --> 00:07:22.030
Superheroes will be unmasked shortly.

00:07:22.030 --> 00:07:25.140
Ultimately resulting in the growth of Team
Arrow.

00:07:25.140 --> 00:07:27.520
It’s getting really crowded in that basement.

00:07:27.520 --> 00:07:30.440
Remember though, there’s still the threat
of a major character dying.

00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:33.660
Currently Thea is at the top of the list.

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:36.260
Let me know who you think is going to die
this season?

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:38.820
Thea, Sara or Moira?

00:07:38.820 --> 00:07:41.270
Remember, Q&amp;A tomorrow.

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:43.760
So leave your questions you want me to include.

00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:47.250
Right now click here for last week’s episode
and click here for that Q&amp;A link.

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:50.430
I’ll add the annotation as soon as I post
it.

00:07:50.430 --> 00:07:51.760
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

00:07:51.760 --> 00:07:51.800
High Fives!

